        "So the last cell is counted too",
        "Because range() can't take a variable"
      ],
      "answer": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "q24",
      "text": "In the Energy Collector mission, what does the program print with 4 cells?",
      "options": ["10", "6", "9", "4"],
      "answer": 3
    },
